          <h2>Let your agents drive the terminal.</h2>
          <p class="chapter-lead">
            An agent that needs to run a test and read the result is flying blind in most terminals.
            Prowl ships a <code>prowl</code> command that talks to the running app over a local socket, so
            agents can see, address and coordinate panes as easily as you can.
          </p>
        </div>
