              <h3>Bundled skills</h3>
              <p class="pitch">
                Prowl ships two agent skills inside the app: <code>prowl-cli</code>, which teaches an agent
                when and how to drive panes safely, and <code>prowl-workflow</code>, which teaches it to
                write and debug workflows. One command links them into your agents' skill folders.
              </p>
              <ul class="facts">
                <li><b>Stays current.</b> Skills are symlinked, so an app update updates the skill.</li>
                <li><b>Manual in the bundle.</b> The full documentation ships in <code>Prowl.app</code>, and <em>Help → Ask Agent About Prowl</em> copies a prompt that points your agent at it.</li>
                <li><b>Same docs, on the web.</b> This site's <a href="/manual/">Manual</a> is built from those files.</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="toggle"><a href="/manual/skills/prowl-cli/">prowl-cli skill</a> · <a href="/manual/skills/prowl-workflow/">prowl-workflow skill</a></p>
